{"name":"-70-E-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_23S_Crossroads_Warrior","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"506","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Berlin Television Broadcasting, Berlin."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"DRF 1 Director","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shadowless, are you transferring over to Channel 2 because Berlin TV's influence is dwindling too much for your liking? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Or is it because Channel 2 is based in Frankfurt, the capital? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"WE, Channel 1, are the cornerstone of Deutscher Rundfunk! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Not to mention it's almost impossible to get a raise or a promotion over at Channel 2—they have too many people! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How about this? I'll put you on the list of employees eligible for a salary adjustment next month... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Several key positions will be vacant next year. I can also put you on the list of nominees..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Shadowless","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...There's no need for that, Director. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I am not transferring to Channel 2 for money or clout, so neither of these will get me to stay. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I simply wish to investigate the truth behind the Pandora Incident."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"DRF 1 Director","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You can spare me that kind of excuse..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Shadowless","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Shadowless","narrator":fals